V1.0–V1.7 incorporated substantial code from daniel27-space/lunar-navigator,
https://github.com/daniel27-space/lunar-navigator, pinned reference
707b035fccbc7829c5ee4cf539c17f0d2d9bb652. Earlier Apache-2.0 assurances were
